    "Spending counts money out. Money in includes refunds. Cash flow is money in minus money out. Transfers, starting balances and balance adjustments are excluded. %@" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ausgaben erfassen Geldabflüsse. Geldzuflüsse enthalten Rückerstattungen. Der Cashflow ist die Differenz aus Geldzuflüssen und Geldabflüssen. Umbuchungen, Anfangssalden und Kontostandsanpassungen sind ausgeschlossen. %1$@"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spending counts money out. Money in includes refunds. Cash flow is money in minus money out. Transfers, starting balances and balance adjustments are excluded. %@"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los gastos cuentan el dinero que sale. Las entradas incluyen los reembolsos. El flujo de caja es entradas menos salidas. Se excluyen las transferencias, los saldos iniciales y los ajustes de saldo. %@"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les dépenses correspondent à l’argent sortant. L’argent entrant comprend les remboursements. Le flux de trésorerie est la différence entre l’argent entrant et sortant. Les virements, les soldes initiaux et les ajustements de solde sont exclus. %1$@"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le spese comprendono il denaro in uscita. Il denaro in entrata include i rimborsi. Il flusso di cassa è la differenza tra entrate e uscite. Sono esclusi trasferimenti, saldi iniziali e rettifiche del saldo. %1$@"
          }
        },
        "sr-Latn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Trošenje računa novac. Novac uključuje povraćaj sredstava. Tok gotovine je novac u minus novac. Transferi, početna stanja i korekcije stanja su isključeni. %1$@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "花钱算钱。资金包括退款。现金流量是流入的钱减去流出的钱。转账、起始余额和余额调整不包括在内。 %1$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
