    "You can say no and use Kualia normally. AppsFlyer can still count limited, anonymized installs and milestones, and Apple can provide aggregate attribution." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sie können ablehnen und Kualia normal nutzen. AppsFlyer kann weiterhin eingeschränkte, anonymisierte Installationen und Meilensteine zählen, und Apple kann aggregierte Attribution bereitstellen."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You can say no and use Kualia normally. AppsFlyer can still count limited, anonymized installs and milestones, and Apple can provide aggregate attribution."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Puedes rechazarlo y usar Kualia normalmente. AppsFlyer puede seguir contando instalaciones e hitos limitados y anonimizados, y Apple puede proporcionar atribución agregada."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vous pouvez refuser et utiliser Kualia normalement. AppsFlyer peut toujours compter des installations et étapes limitées et anonymisées, et Apple peut fournir une attribution agrégée."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Puoi rifiutare e usare Kualia normalmente. AppsFlyer può comunque conteggiare installazioni e traguardi limitati e anonimizzati, e Apple può fornire attribuzione aggregata."
          }
        },
        "sr-Latn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Možete odbiti i normalno koristiti Kualia. AppsFlyer i dalje može da broji ograničene, anonimizovane instalacije i važne korake, a Apple može da pruži zbirnu atribuciju."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "您可以拒绝并正常使用 Kualia。AppsFlyer 仍可统计有限的匿名安装和关键步骤，Apple 也可提供汇总归因。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
