    "You'll lose shared family workspaces and access through the manager's membership. Your own workspaces stay with you. Bank links crossing between you and the family will be unlinked." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Durch die Mitgliedschaft des Managers verlieren Sie die gemeinsamen Familienarbeitsbereiche und den Zugriff. Ihre eigenen Arbeitsbereiche bleiben bei Ihnen. Die zwischen Ihnen und der Familie bestehenden Bankverbindungen werden aufgehoben."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You'll lose shared family workspaces and access through the manager's membership. Your own workspaces stay with you. Bank links crossing between you and the family will be unlinked."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Perderás los espacios familiares compartidos y el acceso mediante la suscripción del administrador. Tus propios espacios siguen contigo. Se desvincularán las conexiones bancarias compartidas entre tú y la familia."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vous perdrez les espaces de travail familiaux partagés et l'accès via l'adhésion du gestionnaire. Vos propres espaces de travail restent avec vous. Les liens bancaires qui se croisent entre vous et la famille seront dissociés."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Perderai gli spazi di lavoro familiari condivisi e l'accesso tramite l'abbonamento del gestore. I tuoi spazi di lavoro restano con te. I collegamenti bancari che si incrociano tra te e la famiglia verranno scollegati."
          }
        },
        "sr-Latn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Izgubit ćete zajedničke porodične radne prostore i pristup preko menadžerskog članstva. Vaš radni prostor ostaje sa vama. Bankovne veze koje prelaze između vas i porodice biće prekinute."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "您将失去共享的家庭工作区以及通过经理会员资格进行的访问。您自己的工作空间将陪伴您左右。您和家人之间的银行联系将被取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're already part of this family." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du bist bereits Teil dieser Familie."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
